{"unit_id":"sala003__dsh-tool-describe-image#feature-1","repo":"sala003/dsh-tool-describe-image","commit":"5c1db6cd0793b0276ccffd390d2640f79f7c9808","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-describe-image 的功能「按路径描述图片」：模型调用 describe_image 并提供路径及可选问题；插件读取支持的图片格式，调用视觉模型后返回文字或 HTML 描述。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:418-460","src/vision-client.ts:100-128"]}
